The consensus was that there is a compatibility problem between the
SWXCR software and the 5.7-4 firmware shipped with 4.0G.  I was
told to either upgrade to 5.7-6 or downgrade to 5.6.  However, the
only other version I had was 5.3, which I was already running prior
